          "python",
          "- Collect 33K prompts\n- Generate multiple outputs per prompt using SFT model\n- Have humans rank outputs (1st best, 2nd, ..., worst)\n- Train reward model on pairwise preferences\n- Output: Reward model that predicts human preference"
        ]
